🔹 📌 Best Practices Recap
Key principles to remember:
• Follow proper directory structure
 • Use roles for reusability
 • Maintain idempotency
 • Secure secrets using Vault
 • Use tags and serial for controlled deployments
 • Debug using verbose mode
Clean structure + secure automation = production-ready DevOps 💡

